Add a "Clean build from the ground up" subsection to the Building section: a
stage table for ./build.sh (toolchain / kernel+libs+userland / contrib /
image, with the SKIP_* knobs), the artifact-removal recipe for a truly clean
rebuild (make -C sys clean; rm -rf dist dist-* contrib/*/build), and a note on
scripts/sync-sysroot.sh — the idempotent, standalone cross-sysroot mirror that
build.sh sources and that can also reconstruct the sysroot without a rebuild.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
